      "id": "net-plus-mission-subnet-calc",
      "title": "Carve the /24",
      "domain_id": "implementation",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "brief": "The plan calls for 8 subnets from 10.20.0.0/16 for new branch offices. Compute the new prefix length and the first two subnet addresses, then submit them.",
      "objectives": [
